1
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,700
=The Road to Splendor=

2
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

3
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:38,000
=Episode 29=

4
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:39,799
How long are you going

5
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:44,439
to keep up this little show?

6
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,879
Mother has barely been laid to rest,

7
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,359
and already you're so eager

8
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:01,480
to squeeze
every last bit of use out of her,

9
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:06,239
just as you did to Grandmother.

10
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,919
I truly felt for

11
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,599
and miss your mother.

12
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:13,520
Everyone,

13
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,639
(In Memoriam)
please go back.

14
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:19,080
As for the funeral,

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,439
the Fu family will make
the arrangements.

16
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:24,800
My condolences, Commander Zhao.

17
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:40,400
When I got married,

18
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,080
Mother was still fine.

19
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,599
How could she suddenly...?

20
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,039
I didn't tell you

21
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:51,199
because I was afraid
you'd blame yourself.

22
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,360
Your mother

23
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:56,360
had always been

24
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:57,879
in poor health.

25
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,599
She feared she wouldn't last,

26
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,400
and that her funeral
would delay your wedding.

27
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,039
Seeing you married,

28
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,400
she was finally at peace.

29
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,800
And then...

30
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,280
she couldn't hold on any longer.

31
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:19,479
Father and Mother often argued.

32
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,759
Mother could never win against him,

33
00:03:21,879 --> 00:03:22,879
so she kept all that distress
bottled up,

34
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:26,280
and took a lot of medicine
to calm her nerves.

35
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:29,199
I thought she'd be all right.

36
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,199
I failed to take proper care of her.

37
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:36,240
Let's stop arguing over this.

38
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,919
Who's right or wrong

39
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,800
doesn't matter.

40
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,039
What matters now

41
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:47,520
is giving your mother a proper funeral

42
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,479
and a dignified send-off.

43
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,240
I've decided

44
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,039
to build a mourning hut here

45
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,120
and mourn my late wife.

46
00:03:58,919 --> 00:04:00,599
I failed her while she was alive.

47
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,919
Now that she's gone,

48
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,039
I won't fail her again.

49
00:04:10,759 --> 00:04:12,479
Mother's true last wish

50
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,520
was to return home after death,

51
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,759
back to her roots.

52
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,199
I will take her coffin

53
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,680
back to the Xie family in Jiangnan.

54
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,160
Enough.

55
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,399
You are no longer part of the Fu family.

56
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,879
What right do you have
to meddle in our affairs?

57
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:29,680
What about me?

58
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,279
I'm a daughter-in-law of the Fu family.

59
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,480
Do I have the right to decide
for Mother?

60
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,079
Don't you dare!

61
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:40,360
Don't think that just because someone
powerful backs you

62
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,959
means you can defy me.

63
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,800
After everything the Fu family
has done for you! Ungrateful wretches!

64
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,240
I gave this life of mine

65
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:55,079
back to the Fu family long ago

66
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,279
at Biyun Nunnery.

67
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,199
Today,

68
00:04:59,199 --> 00:05:01,279
you can talk until you are blue
in the face,

69
00:05:01,879 --> 00:05:04,639
but I will still take Mother back
to the Xie family in Jiangnan!

70
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:06,199
You dare defy me!

71
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:08,120
You...

72
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:20,000
It wasn't enough that you drove Mother
to her death.

73
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,680
Now you want to use her death
to polish your own reputation?

74
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,199
Fine.

75
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:29,240
From this day forward,

76
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:31,560
our ties are severed!

77
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:34,240
You can keep your empty grave

78
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,439
and fend for yourself!

79
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:37,319
Live out the rest of your life
however you please!

80
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,079
Fine!

81
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,800
Fu Tingyun, listen to me.

82
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:42,160
Your mother

83
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,319
belonged to the Fu family in life

84
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,600
and she remains one in death!

85
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,920
She'll be buried

86
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,040
wherever I say she will!

87
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:51,800
I'll burn her body right now!

88
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,560
Mother!

89
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,360
Mother!

90
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,240
Mother!

91
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:14,839
I don't want Mother

92
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:18,360
to remain here another day.

93
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,920
I've already asked Uncle

94
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,680
to make arrangements in Jiangnan.

95
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:28,639
As soon as the documents arrive,

96
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,639
I'll take Mother

97
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:33,480
back to Jiangnan.

98
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,399
Mother,

99
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,040
from now on,

100
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:45,120
you no longer have to be
the Fu family's dutiful wife.

101
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:48,600
You can be once again

102
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,680
the carefree young lady you were
in the Xie family.

103
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,920
♪Lone wild geese know not
late autumn's woes♪

104
00:06:56,480 --> 00:07:00,439
♪If heaven's will, none can implore♪

105
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:02,160
The Fu family's ancestral home
is in Huaying,

106
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:04,120
west of the capital.

107
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:06,360
Yet Fifth Madam Fu's coffin

108
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,000
is being carried south.

109
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,279
Fifth Madam Fu left a final wish:

110
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,879
never to be buried
in the Fu family graveyard

111
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:13,439
or beside her husband.

112
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,199
So her coffin is being taken south,

113
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,560
back to the Xie family in Jiangnan.

114
00:07:17,199 --> 00:07:19,040
Fifth Master Fu prides himself
on his filial devotion,

115
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,000
yet both his children

116
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,519
honor their mother and not their father.

117
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,879
That tells you

118
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,800
what awful things he must've done
behind closed doors.

119
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:28,879
I'm planning

120
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,000
to return to Huaying
and join your brother.

121
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,800
Father refuses

122
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,920
to leave the capital.

123
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,879
If he causes you any trouble,

124
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:36,879
write to me.

125
00:07:36,879 --> 00:07:38,240
I'll ask the clan elders to step in

126
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,120
and speak up for you.

127
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,439
You fulfilled Mother's final wish

128
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,560
and took her back to Jiangnan.

129
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:47,480
You've had to endure
plenty of criticism for it.

130
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:49,279
You've been through a lot.

131
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,839
Your Majesty,

132
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:01,399
at his wedding banquet, Commander Zhao

133
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,360
publicly vowed to honor Fifth Madam Fu

134
00:08:03,439 --> 00:08:04,680
as his own mother

135
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,360
and care for her as such.

136
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:08,439
The story was praised
throughout the capital.

137
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,560
Now that Fifth Madam Fu has passed away,

138
00:08:10,639 --> 00:08:13,240
Commander Zhao has shown
no sign of observing mourning.

139
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:15,879
If his filial devotion was nothing
but empty words,

140
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:18,360
the people will surely be disappointed.

141
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,560
With such conduct,

142
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,399
how can he set an example
for the other officials?

143
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,519
I disagree.

144
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,560
It was merely a ceremonial gesture.

145
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,240
Surely he isn't expected
to actually observe mourning.

146
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,639
That would be absurd!

147
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,240
Your Majesty,

148
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,960
I had already intended

149
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,080
to request a hundred days of mourning
in filial duty,

150
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,399
to remain with my wife

151
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,559
and see my mother-in-law off
on her final journey.

152
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:44,600
Very well.

153
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,320
Your decision, Commander Zhao,

154
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:47,600
is an act of true filial devotion.

155
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,639
Granted.

156
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,159
Madam Zhao

157
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,840
has been overcome by grief and worry.

158
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,799
She has just lost her mother.

159
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:08,440
She'll need some time to recover.

160
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,679
Did I wake you?

161
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:39,600
Here.

162
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,399
Drink your medicine first.

163
00:09:49,279 --> 00:09:50,159
I added

164
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:52,559
three qian of candied osmanthus
to the medicine.

165
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,360
It won't be bitter.

166
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:14,799
Why didn't you

167
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:17,240
attend court today?

168
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,919
Mr. Zhao has set up a memorial hall

169
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,039
for Fifth Madam

170
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,600
and will mourn her for a hundred days.

171
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,240
By custom,

172
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:34,399
a son-in-law

173
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:36,799
is not required to mourn
his mother-in-law,

174
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:40,399
much less take leave
from office and court.

175
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,120
Right now

176
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,440
is the most critical time
in the investigation.

177
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:48,919
I'm afraid

178
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:50,879
I'm holding you back.

179
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,080
From now on,

180
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,399
don't ever say you're holding me back.

181
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,320
Mother-in-law treated me
with nothing but kindness.

182
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,440
These hundred days of mourning

183
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:11,039
are something I willingly chose
to observe.

184
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,519
This isn't about custom.

185
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:17,960
It's about what feels right.

186
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:20,559
Besides,

187
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,080
the court is hardly

188
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,440
going to grind to a halt

189
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,000
without me.

190
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:31,840
Don't worry.

191
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:33,960
Going through the account books

192
00:11:34,879 --> 00:11:36,000
takes time and effort,

193
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,639
but I've already made arrangements.

194
00:11:39,799 --> 00:11:41,000
Right now,

195
00:11:41,519 --> 00:11:42,519
what matters most to me

196
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,639
is your health.

197
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:52,039
We'll see

198
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:56,960
Mother off together.

199
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:05,120
Are you still feeling unwell?

200
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,080
I'll get a healer.

201
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,840
It's nothing.

202
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:41,759
I was just thinking about Mother.

203
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:56,160
(After One Hundred Days of Mourning)

204
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,519
(Ministry of Revenue)

205
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,879
Every entry must be accounted for.

206
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:01,320
- Yes.
- All right.

207
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,960
(Censorate)

208
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,559
Lord Liu.

209
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:08,799
There can be no mistakes.

210
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:09,159
Yes.

211
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,440
Check everything carefully!

212
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,159
Yes.

213
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,640
(Three hundred salt permits
were issued above quota)

214
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,679
Your Majesty,

215
00:13:30,279 --> 00:13:31,639
the Anzhou salt-tax accounts

216
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,120
have been thoroughly investigated.

217
00:13:35,039 --> 00:13:36,000
There are indeed irregularities.

218
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,000
Your Majesty,

219
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:40,120
the Ministry of Revenue reviewed
six years' worth of account books

220
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,320
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)
from regions under the old system.

221
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,200
Upon examination,

222
00:13:43,399 --> 00:13:44,440
the issuing of salt permits,

223
00:13:44,679 --> 00:13:46,440
transport losses, and other entries

224
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:48,440
are riddled with discrepancies.

225
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,399
In autumn and winter of last year alone,

226
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,639
the shortfall reached

227
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,320
one hundred thousand taels.

228
00:13:58,039 --> 00:13:58,759
Minister Yu,

229
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,240
Anzhou's salt administration

230
00:14:00,639 --> 00:14:02,519
has always been under your supervision.

231
00:14:03,879 --> 00:14:05,480
I did fail in my oversight.

232
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,759
Your Majesty, please punish me.

233
00:14:07,639 --> 00:14:08,399
However...

234
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,039
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)
Your Majesty,

235
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:13,120
the Censorate also examined salt-tax
accounts across the realm

236
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,799
and found discrepancies
in salt-permit figures

237
00:14:14,879 --> 00:14:15,960
and storage losses

238
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,120
to be quite common.

239
00:14:17,279 --> 00:14:19,480
Last year's losses in the three
northwestern garrisons

240
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,799
were even greater

241
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:22,399
than those in Anzhou.

242
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:32,440
Why is the Censorate investigating
this too?

243
00:14:34,799 --> 00:14:37,120
You knew the Ministry of Revenue
was investigating Anzhou.

244
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:40,639
Why didn't we investigate together?

245
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:48,360
The Censorate acted on its own.

246
00:14:48,519 --> 00:14:50,279
That risks muddying the issue.

247
00:14:51,559 --> 00:14:52,960
If there truly is a shortfall
in the northwest,

248
00:14:53,759 --> 00:14:55,200
I am willing to investigate that
as well.

249
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:55,799
Enough.

250
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,799
Salt-tax accounts

251
00:14:58,440 --> 00:15:00,080
have always been a mess.

252
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:02,559
Now you want to dig
through every last one?

253
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,240
Do you think my realm

254
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:07,159
is too peaceful?

255
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:09,120
In my humble opinion,

256
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,840
Commander Zhao is examining
the old accounts

257
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,679
only to make up the shortfall.

258
00:15:12,679 --> 00:15:14,240
If we can determine an exact amount,

259
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:16,120
I am willing

260
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:18,759
to find a way to raise the funds.

261
00:15:21,639 --> 00:15:22,000
Your Majesty,

262
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:22,919
reasonable storage losses

263
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,440
have always existed.

264
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:25,840
That's enough

265
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:27,200
for today.

266
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,480
The court is dismissed!

267
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,000
We respectfully bid
Your Majesty farewell!

268
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,279
Commander Zhao.

269
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,440
A young man should know when to stop.

270
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:44,960
Act too recklessly,

271
00:15:45,879 --> 00:15:47,600
and your family may pay the price.

272
00:15:48,919 --> 00:15:50,600
What do you mean by that?

273
00:15:50,679 --> 00:15:52,759
If you hadn't been so determined
to investigate those accounts,

274
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,600
would your mother-in-law

275
00:15:56,039 --> 00:15:59,120
have died so suddenly?

276
00:15:59,799 --> 00:16:01,039
Today,

277
00:16:01,759 --> 00:16:03,440
you are willing to part
with your mother-in-law.

278
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,399
Tomorrow,

279
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,919
who else will you be willing
to part with?

280
00:16:21,639 --> 00:16:22,879
(Please)

281
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,600
(escort her to the capital.)

282
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,960
(I am willing to reward you)

283
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:28,559
(ten thousand taels of silver)

284
00:16:28,759 --> 00:16:29,879
(for your trouble.)

285
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,879
(My only wish is that the two of you)

286
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,679
(will always be of one heart)

287
00:16:35,879 --> 00:16:37,320
(and weather every storm together.)

288
00:16:38,399 --> 00:16:39,879
(A blessed union.)

289
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:42,240
(Bound as one forever.)

290
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,440
(A match made in heaven.)

291
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,720
(Together through a hundred years.)

292
00:16:47,879 --> 00:16:49,039
(May you always)

293
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,759
(ride a fine steed)

294
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,440
(and rise to great heights.)

295
00:16:54,279 --> 00:16:55,200
(Thank you, Mother.)

296
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:22,000
(Renshen-Aconite Life-Saving Decoction)

297
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:26,960
Who is it?

298
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:35,880
(If you hadn't been so determined
to investigate those accounts,)

299
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,720
(would your mother-in-law)

300
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:42,240
(have died so suddenly?)

301
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:55,119
Do you recognize this prescription?

302
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,279
Commander Zhao,

303
00:17:58,200 --> 00:18:00,000
my eyesight is failing with age.

304
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,240
I can't make it out clearly.

305
00:18:01,519 --> 00:18:02,400
Take another look.

306
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:04,519
The owner of Rengui Pharmacy
in the neighboring county

307
00:18:04,519 --> 00:18:05,839
said you traveled a great distance

308
00:18:06,839 --> 00:18:08,680
specifically to have
this prescription filled.

309
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:12,759
(Madam!)

310
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,000
(Madam!)

311
00:18:21,359 --> 00:18:22,200
My wife

312
00:18:22,839 --> 00:18:23,920
was in poor health.

313
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,240
It was to calm her nerves.

314
00:18:41,559 --> 00:18:42,440
What are you doing?

315
00:18:42,799 --> 00:18:43,759
This medicine

316
00:18:44,799 --> 00:18:46,440
was prepared from this
very prescription.

317
00:18:47,119 --> 00:18:48,960
If it's really meant to calm the nerves,

318
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,599
why don't you try it yourself?

319
00:18:51,319 --> 00:18:52,799
You want to kill me?

320
00:18:56,079 --> 00:18:57,039
Zhao Ling.

321
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,519
You don't know who you're dealing with.

322
00:18:58,519 --> 00:18:59,559
You want to kill me?

323
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,440
Do you even know

324
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:01,880
who's backing me?

325
00:19:02,119 --> 00:19:03,319
You can't afford to cross them!

326
00:19:03,319 --> 00:19:03,960
Who?

327
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,440
The Yu family?

328
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:08,440
You should be wondering

329
00:19:08,599 --> 00:19:10,240
why I came here tonight,

330
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,440
and who

331
00:19:12,119 --> 00:19:14,400
told me what you've done.

332
00:19:15,279 --> 00:19:16,160
Yu Guodong,

333
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,000
you old scumbag.

334
00:19:18,519 --> 00:19:19,920
You betrayed me.

335
00:19:22,559 --> 00:19:23,200
My son-in-law...

336
00:19:25,599 --> 00:19:26,839
These are all the letters

337
00:19:26,839 --> 00:19:28,400
between the Yu family and me.

338
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,279
Everything I've done wrong...

339
00:19:30,279 --> 00:19:31,640
they made me do it.

340
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,119
And Madam Yu...

341
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:34,519
she was the one who told me

342
00:19:34,519 --> 00:19:35,440
to have Ms. Li

343
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,160
frame you.

344
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,079
And Xie...

345
00:19:37,079 --> 00:19:38,920
they arranged her death too.

346
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,359
Take them.

347
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,319
They're all yours.

348
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:42,359
Consider it your father-in-law's love
for you.

349
00:19:43,519 --> 00:19:44,359
Don't!

350
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,480
Even if you threw the letters away,

351
00:19:48,599 --> 00:19:50,000
you also have my confession.

352
00:19:50,519 --> 00:19:52,279
You'll bring them down.

353
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,759
Spare me.

354
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:04,559
My great son-in-law, please spare me.

355
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,200
If you let me go,

356
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:08,359
I'll never seek reinstatement again.

357
00:20:08,359 --> 00:20:10,200
I'll just live as a retired old man
of the Fu family.

358
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:12,359
The Emperor rules through filial piety.

359
00:20:12,359 --> 00:20:13,759
I'll spread word of your filial devotion

360
00:20:13,759 --> 00:20:14,759
throughout the realm!

361
00:20:14,759 --> 00:20:16,599
It will only help your reputation
and career.

362
00:20:16,599 --> 00:20:17,599
I'm begging you!

363
00:20:17,599 --> 00:20:19,039
Please let me go!

364
00:20:20,319 --> 00:20:21,960
If Mother were still alive

365
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:24,880
and you had brought these out then...

366
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:29,039
perhaps for Quanhui's sake,

367
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,680
I might have still seen you
as my father-in-law.

368
00:20:32,519 --> 00:20:34,000
But if I accept this now,

369
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:36,319
what would that mean for her?

370
00:20:37,279 --> 00:20:37,880
Zhao Ling,

371
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:39,960
you're a fourth-rank official now.

372
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:41,079
A fourth-rank official.

373
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,839
In five years, you reached

374
00:20:42,839 --> 00:20:45,000
what I couldn't achieve
in my entire life.

375
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:47,839
Are you willing to throw away
such a promising future?

376
00:20:47,839 --> 00:20:49,000
Please spare me!

377
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,079
According to you,

378
00:20:51,519 --> 00:20:52,839
this bowl of medicine...

379
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,759
is just for calming the nerves.

380
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:00,200
I don't want anything anymore!

381
00:21:00,559 --> 00:21:02,480
Please let me go!

382
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,559
Zhao Ling!

383
00:21:03,759 --> 00:21:05,319
Even if I am a heartless wretch,

384
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,279
I am still Fu Tingyun's birth father!

385
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:09,599
You two will pay for this!

386
00:21:11,079 --> 00:21:12,240
I'll bear...

387
00:21:15,599 --> 00:21:17,000
the consequences myself.

388
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,799
I am

389
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:29,440
the consequence you deserve.

390
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:32,920
I don't want anything.

391
00:21:33,079 --> 00:21:34,440
Please, let me go.

392
00:21:35,599 --> 00:21:37,200
Please, let me go!

393
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:08,800
(Yunshe Hut)

394
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:14,559
Clean everything up.

395
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,079
Leave no loose ends.

396
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:20,519
Don't let them get anything on us.

397
00:22:21,559 --> 00:22:22,079
Yes.

398
00:22:43,759 --> 00:22:44,519
Madam,

399
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:47,160
servants from Fifth Master Fu's
household

400
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,480
say they have an urgent matter

401
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:49,519
and wish to see you.

402
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:53,279
Let them in.

403
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,039
Come in.

404
00:22:58,519 --> 00:22:59,400
Ninth Young Lady.

405
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,440
Something happened to the Fu family.

406
00:23:02,839 --> 00:23:03,759
Please,

407
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:06,160
you must tell us what to do.

408
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:11,079
The day Mother's coffin was taken away,

409
00:23:11,599 --> 00:23:12,680
I made it clear

410
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,440
that I had severed all ties
with Fifth Master.

411
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,799
I was no longer part of the Fu family.

412
00:23:19,079 --> 00:23:21,000
What happened this time

413
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:23,759
that you came to me for answers?

414
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:24,880
Fifth Master...

415
00:23:26,559 --> 00:23:27,720
is gone.

416
00:23:37,079 --> 00:23:38,079
What did you say?

417
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:39,440
There was heavy rain yesterday.

418
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,319
The thatched hut was leaking badly.

419
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,319
Master ordered us

420
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,720
to cut wood in the mountains

421
00:23:45,079 --> 00:23:46,160
to repair the roof.

422
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:48,200
We worked through the night.

423
00:23:49,119 --> 00:23:50,759
When we returned at dawn,

424
00:23:51,559 --> 00:23:52,960
the hut had already been

425
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:55,759
burned to ashes.

426
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:56,839
I...

427
00:23:56,839 --> 00:23:57,880
The villagers said

428
00:23:58,079 --> 00:23:59,079
that around midnight,

429
00:23:59,519 --> 00:24:01,039
they saw flames shooting into the sky.

430
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,480
They called out for a long time,

431
00:24:03,079 --> 00:24:04,599
but no one answered.

432
00:24:06,079 --> 00:24:07,640
Didn't you just say

433
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:09,079
there was heavy rain last night?

434
00:24:09,079 --> 00:24:10,240
The hut was soaked through!

435
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:12,200
Then how did such a fire start?

436
00:24:12,519 --> 00:24:13,400
I...

437
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:14,599
truly don't know.

438
00:24:14,799 --> 00:24:16,599
Seventh Young Master has already
taken the coffin home.

439
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:19,079
There's no one left in the household
to take charge.

440
00:24:19,279 --> 00:24:20,079
Next,

441
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:22,119
the death report, burial arrangements,
and all related procedures

442
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:23,759
must be reported to the authorities.

443
00:24:24,079 --> 00:24:25,079
We can only beg you

444
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:26,680
to take charge!

445
00:24:34,799 --> 00:24:36,640
Before Tingzhuo and his wife left,

446
00:24:38,519 --> 00:24:40,200
they left their personal seal with me.

447
00:24:40,839 --> 00:24:42,160
Get a visiting card prepared,

448
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,680
and take it to the authorities
to report the death.

449
00:24:44,079 --> 00:24:46,079
I'll send word back to our family
in Huaying.

450
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:47,559
Keep the funeral simple.

451
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:51,119
I'll have the accountant prepare

452
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:53,400
a list of the coffin specifications

453
00:24:53,799 --> 00:24:55,039
and burial clothes we need,

454
00:24:56,079 --> 00:24:57,440
and in an hour,

455
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,559
I'll give it to you both.

456
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:01,240
I'll also provide

457
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:03,559
all the money you need.

458
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:05,240
Thank you, Ninth Young Lady.

459
00:25:16,839 --> 00:25:18,960
You are willing to handle
his funeral arrangements,

460
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:20,319
and this gesture

461
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:23,160
is enough to repay the bond
of blood between you.

462
00:25:23,839 --> 00:25:25,880
If you don't have the strength
to handle everything,

463
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,079
tell Mr. Zhao.

464
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:30,480
Let him take care of it for you.

465
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:32,880
Mr. Zhao...

466
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:43,240
He didn't come home all night.

467
00:25:46,559 --> 00:25:48,480
He only returned early this morning.

468
00:26:42,119 --> 00:26:43,759
The Fu family sent word this morning.

469
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,559
They said the hut caught fire.

470
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:48,880
Father...

471
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,559
didn't make it out.

472
00:26:55,319 --> 00:26:56,839
He had grown used to living
in that hut while mourning.

473
00:26:58,079 --> 00:26:59,079
With incense burning day and night,

474
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:02,079
accidents could happen.

475
00:27:05,279 --> 00:27:06,720
Where were you

476
00:27:08,519 --> 00:27:09,920
last night?

477
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:13,440
Were you at the yamen?

478
00:27:36,079 --> 00:27:38,839
I had already cut all ties with him.

479
00:27:40,839 --> 00:27:42,559
We had nothing to do with each other.

480
00:27:44,519 --> 00:27:46,759
Why did you still get involved with him?

481
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:50,799
He is still my father.

482
00:27:53,079 --> 00:27:54,920
No matter how many reasons there were,

483
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,920
you shouldn't have done this.

484
00:27:58,319 --> 00:28:00,400
Least of all, you.

485
00:28:21,920 --> 00:28:23,319
Fifth Master had committed grave sins.

486
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:29,200
What happened with Ms. Li before

487
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,920
was arranged by him and the Yu family.

488
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:33,680
They colluded from within and without.

489
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:36,240
Rather than guarding
against a thief every day,

490
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:38,200
I thought it would be better...

491
00:29:16,680 --> 00:29:17,400
Quanhui,

492
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:28,559
you resent me.

493
00:29:29,559 --> 00:29:31,480
I just can't understand...

494
00:29:35,839 --> 00:29:38,119
What reason did you have

495
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:42,400
for crossing such a line?

496
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:53,039
There were ten thousand reasons
not to kill him.

497
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,880
But Mr. Zhao's reason for killing him

498
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:58,440
was the ten-thousand-and-first.

499
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,559
Why not tell her?

500
00:30:00,039 --> 00:30:01,039
If this continues,

501
00:30:01,279 --> 00:30:02,839
it will only drive a wedge between them.

502
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:05,599
You tell her.

503
00:30:06,799 --> 00:30:07,599
No way.

504
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:08,599
You do it.

505
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:11,119
How could I?

506
00:30:11,599 --> 00:30:12,880
This concerns family ethics.

507
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:14,680
If Madam Zhao finds out

508
00:30:15,079 --> 00:30:17,319
that her own father caused
her mother's death,

509
00:30:17,480 --> 00:30:18,000
then...

510
00:30:18,559 --> 00:30:19,559
My heavens,

511
00:30:20,079 --> 00:30:22,200
you might as well be asking
Mr. Zhao to rip out his own heart.

512
00:32:11,559 --> 00:32:13,559
(If you hadn't been so determined
to investigate those accounts,)

513
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:14,960
(would your mother-in-law)

514
00:32:15,920 --> 00:32:18,960
(have died so suddenly?)

515
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:20,599
(Today,)

516
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:22,559
(you are willing to part
with your mother-in-law.)

517
00:32:23,559 --> 00:32:24,319
(Tomorrow,)

518
00:32:25,039 --> 00:32:26,640
(who else will you be willing
to part with?)

519
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:34,440
(The Yu family...)

520
00:32:34,519 --> 00:32:36,559
(I'll make you pay for every drop
of blood you've shed.)

521
00:32:42,560 --> 00:32:44,600
(Xie Residence)

522
00:32:46,319 --> 00:32:47,079
Commander Zhao,

523
00:32:47,519 --> 00:32:49,000
what a pleasant mood you're in today.

524
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:51,079
You went out of your way
to invite us here.

525
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:52,200
Don't tell me

526
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,559
it's just to watch fish.

527
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:55,880
Lord Wei, don't underestimate
these ornamental carp.

528
00:32:57,160 --> 00:32:58,559
They may look ordinary,

529
00:33:00,079 --> 00:33:01,119
but they have quite a history.

530
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:04,640
This one in particular
is quite impressive.

531
00:33:05,079 --> 00:33:05,960
Commander Zhao,

532
00:33:06,079 --> 00:33:07,440
what makes it so special?

533
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:08,440
This fish

534
00:33:10,599 --> 00:33:11,839
came from Yongning Prefecture.

535
00:33:12,640 --> 00:33:14,319
Its lineage has long been tied
to noble families.

536
00:33:15,039 --> 00:33:15,960
One of its descendants

537
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:18,279
was once kept in the Hanlin
Academy's pond.

538
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:21,039
Now it has even taken on the prestige
of the Grand Secretariat.

539
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:25,079
It is anything but ordinary.

540
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:26,880
This fish

541
00:33:27,079 --> 00:33:28,759
has lived in the capital for years.

542
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,680
And now,

543
00:33:29,799 --> 00:33:31,039
the entire pond

544
00:33:31,119 --> 00:33:32,519
belongs to it.

545
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:34,960
Look around it.

546
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:36,880
All its followers gather around it,
don't they?

547
00:33:37,599 --> 00:33:38,759
But this fish

548
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:41,279
feeds only on lotus stems.

549
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:45,319
If we wish to preserve
this pond of blossoms,

550
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:49,079
it must be removed.

551
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:56,039
The question is,

552
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,559
whether you gentlemen are willing
to lend me a hand.

553
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:01,440
Help me build a new pond today,

554
00:34:02,519 --> 00:34:03,880
and when we harvest
the lotus seeds in the future,

555
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:09,039
I will be sure to share them with you.

556
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:20,079
I've loved lotus flowers
since childhood.

557
00:34:20,119 --> 00:34:22,159
I've long had enough of this greedy fish

558
00:34:22,159 --> 00:34:23,679
that has ruined the entire pond.

559
00:34:24,599 --> 00:34:26,079
Hearing that from you, Commander Zhao,

560
00:34:26,559 --> 00:34:28,199
I feel much more at ease.

561
00:34:29,239 --> 00:34:29,719
Come here.

562
00:34:34,079 --> 00:34:35,079
I'll lend you my support.

563
00:34:38,320 --> 00:34:38,920
I...

564
00:34:39,159 --> 00:34:40,159
I'll help you as well.

565
00:34:41,679 --> 00:34:42,400
Commander Zhao,

566
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:43,559
you have my support too.

567
00:34:43,559 --> 00:34:44,280
Mine as well.

568
00:34:44,280 --> 00:34:45,480
I'm willing to assist you,
Commander Zhao.

569
00:34:50,199 --> 00:34:51,039
Commander Zhao,

570
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:52,239
you know me well.

571
00:34:52,679 --> 00:34:53,920
Whether it is

572
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:54,840
helping you catch the fish,

573
00:34:54,960 --> 00:34:56,280
or taking your lotus seeds,

574
00:34:56,679 --> 00:34:57,480
I still need

575
00:34:57,719 --> 00:34:58,400
to go back

576
00:34:58,400 --> 00:34:59,559
and seek approval first.

577
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,159
Lord Wei...

578
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:33,680
(Prayers offered for Fu Shichang's
peaceful rebirth.)

579
00:35:36,159 --> 00:35:37,440
A man like Fifth Master Fu...

580
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,440
when it came to raising children,

581
00:35:39,440 --> 00:35:41,800
only did his part for a brief moment.

582
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:44,280
The nurturing and upbringing

583
00:35:44,840 --> 00:35:46,840
were all handled by Fifth Madam alone.

584
00:35:47,079 --> 00:35:48,000
In the end,

585
00:35:48,239 --> 00:35:50,079
this seven-day Buddhist memorial service

586
00:35:50,239 --> 00:35:51,280
has finally settled

587
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:52,800
the bond between you and him.

588
00:35:53,719 --> 00:35:55,599
It's a pity he left so suddenly.

589
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:56,840
Fifth Madam

590
00:35:57,599 --> 00:35:58,880
would probably still blame him even now.

591
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:01,639
He and my mother were never
on the same path.

592
00:36:02,159 --> 00:36:03,679
They will not meet again
in the afterlife.

593
00:36:16,119 --> 00:36:16,840
Do we

594
00:36:16,840 --> 00:36:17,880
have guests?

595
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:19,079
Mr. Zhao has guests today.

596
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:20,599
We didn't expect you back so soon,

597
00:36:20,679 --> 00:36:21,400
so he didn't say anything.

598
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,079
Who are the guests?

599
00:36:24,719 --> 00:36:25,920
Lord Wei from the Ministry of Personnel,

600
00:36:26,119 --> 00:36:27,079
and Lord Zhu from the Ministry
of Revenue.

601
00:36:32,639 --> 00:36:34,079
If word gets out

602
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:36,039
about what you did today,

603
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:38,960
you'll be accused of forming a faction.

604
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:40,599
The Yu family has tremendous power.

605
00:36:42,079 --> 00:36:43,079
One cannot stand against such power.

606
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:45,719
There was no other choice.

607
00:36:47,159 --> 00:36:49,239
But why rush into it now?

608
00:36:50,280 --> 00:36:51,280
There are things

609
00:36:52,599 --> 00:36:53,920
Grand Secretary Yu can do,

610
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:55,719
but you cannot.

611
00:36:57,440 --> 00:36:58,840
Take forming factions, for example.

612
00:36:59,760 --> 00:37:00,559
These people

613
00:37:01,079 --> 00:37:03,000
may throw stones at you
in this pavilion today,

614
00:37:03,840 --> 00:37:04,559
but tomorrow,

615
00:37:05,679 --> 00:37:08,199
they'll throw blades at you
in the court.

616
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,880
You hold a high position now.

617
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:15,920
Why not learn from Grand Secretary Tian?

618
00:37:18,599 --> 00:37:19,400
Today,

619
00:37:22,559 --> 00:37:23,519
where did you go?

620
00:37:31,039 --> 00:37:32,079
I smell sandalwood.

621
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:35,679
You went to the temple?

622
00:37:38,920 --> 00:37:40,239
At Tanshui Temple,

623
00:37:42,639 --> 00:37:44,039
I prayed to cleanse away obstacles
and seek blessings.

624
00:37:45,079 --> 00:37:47,000
You arranged a Buddhist memorial
service for Fifth Master Fu?

625
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,559
I didn't do it only for him.

626
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:57,320
I did it for you.

627
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:00,800
Mr. Zhao.

628
00:38:02,079 --> 00:38:04,079
I don't think I understand you anymore.

629
00:38:08,559 --> 00:38:09,760
Do you think

630
00:38:10,599 --> 00:38:11,639
I'm beyond forgiveness?

631
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:17,079
You took the blame

632
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,039
for him.

633
00:38:23,920 --> 00:38:26,119
A prudent man
does not put himself in harm's way.

634
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:27,559
Mr. Zhao,

635
00:38:28,719 --> 00:38:30,079
there's a raging fire ahead.

636
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:32,719
Rushing straight into it
may feel satisfying,

637
00:38:33,519 --> 00:38:35,079
but you could destroy yourself.

638
00:38:36,079 --> 00:38:38,199
We've come so far to get
where we are today.

639
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:40,440
Why must you rush this?

640
00:38:41,559 --> 00:38:42,199
Could you...

641
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:44,960
Could you take a more measured approach?

642
00:38:47,599 --> 00:38:48,960
Please, do it for my sake.

643
00:38:55,639 --> 00:38:56,679
There's no time.

644
00:38:58,119 --> 00:39:00,079
Grand Secretary Yu and I are already
locked in a fight to the bitter end.

645
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:02,880
I cannot back down now.

646
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:08,039
Why?

647
00:39:09,159 --> 00:39:10,719
Back in Linchun Town,

648
00:39:10,719 --> 00:39:11,840
you listened to me.

649
00:39:12,519 --> 00:39:14,079
Even though officials and merchants
walk different paths,

650
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:16,480
you still chose to investigate
the case with me.

651
00:39:17,079 --> 00:39:18,559
And in Yongning Prefecture,

652
00:39:19,199 --> 00:39:20,760
you listened to me then too.

653
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:23,840
Even when you wanted nothing
more than a quiet life,

654
00:39:24,679 --> 00:39:26,199
you still chose to join the army.

655
00:39:27,559 --> 00:39:30,079
So why now, when I'm only asking you
to slow down,

656
00:39:31,480 --> 00:39:32,960
can you no longer listen to me?

657
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:38,559
Quanhui.

658
00:39:40,639 --> 00:39:42,440
Court battles may not spill blood,

659
00:39:44,079 --> 00:39:46,440
but they are far more dangerous
than wars at the border.

660
00:39:48,679 --> 00:39:50,159
Everything depends on this.

661
00:39:51,599 --> 00:39:52,760
I have to win.

662
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:56,679
Only then can I protect everyone.

663
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:01,039
Only then can I keep you safe.

664
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:12,320
But I want to protect you too.

665
00:40:19,560 --> 00:40:22,000
(Next Episode)

666
00:40:22,159 --> 00:40:23,039
The Northwest

667
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:24,920
is where Mr. Zhao comes from.

668
00:40:25,079 --> 00:40:26,239
I simply cannot

669
00:40:26,400 --> 00:40:27,719
stand by and watch him fight alone.

670
00:40:27,719 --> 00:40:29,039
He couldn't have pulled off

671
00:40:29,039 --> 00:40:30,400
something this flawless on his own.

672
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:32,599
I only hope this bloodstained garment

673
00:40:33,039 --> 00:40:34,519
will finally see the light of day.

674
00:40:35,119 --> 00:40:36,639
You are a Grand Secretary of the court.

675
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:38,599
How could you commit

676
00:40:38,599 --> 00:40:39,840
such a violation of human decency?

677
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:40,840
Insolence!

678
00:40:41,639 --> 00:40:43,159
This is clearly a frame-up.

679
00:40:43,159 --> 00:40:43,920
Commander Zhao

680
00:40:44,159 --> 00:40:45,079
is simply trying

681
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:46,599
to take revenge.

682
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:49,039
If you insist on fighting head-on,

683
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:51,320
you'll be the egg that cracks.

684
00:41:04,520 --> 00:41:08,840
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

685
00:41:12,440 --> 00:41:16,800
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

686
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:23,560
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

687
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:26,600
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

688
00:41:27,760 --> 00:41:32,400
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

689
00:41:35,600 --> 00:41:42,440
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

690
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:49,840
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

691
00:41:50,800 --> 00:41:54,240
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

692
00:41:54,760 --> 00:41:58,960
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

693
00:41:59,240 --> 00:42:04,920
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

694
00:42:17,040 --> 00:42:20,920
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

695
00:42:24,840 --> 00:42:28,840
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

696
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:35,240
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

697
00:42:35,560 --> 00:42:38,240
♪Kept close within my heart♪

698
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:44,160
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

699
00:42:47,680 --> 00:42:54,600
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

700
00:42:55,480 --> 00:43:01,960
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

701
00:43:02,840 --> 00:43:06,360
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

702
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:11,160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

703
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:17,080
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

